<title>USA: Pegasus prices preferred offering.</title>
<headline>Pegasus prices preferred offering.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pegasus Communications Corp said that it has priced $100 million of 12-3/4 percent Series A Cumulative Exchangeable Preferred Stock due 2007 and warrants to purchase 193,600 shares of Class A common stock.</p>
<p>The proceeds from the offering will be used to fund acquisitions, repay debt and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp is the lead underwriter for this offering. Lehman Brothers and BT Securities Corp acted as co-managers of the offering.</p>
